## Key Concepts

- Kleene 3-valued logic with unknown (U) support
- Implication defined as ¬A ∨ B
- Backtracking propagation to avoid false outcomes

## Code Example

```javascript
function kleeneImpl(a,b){
  const not = v => v==='T'?'F': v==='F'?'T':'U';
  const order = {'F':0,'U':1,'T':2};
  const na = not(a);
  const vals = [na, b];
  return vals.reduce((m,x)=> order[x] > order[m] ? x : m, 'F');
}
```

